// tool.worker, three-quarter: the worker's hammer and anvil, drawn over every
// other layer while act_worker plays. The anvil stands at screen right in all
// three frames, its base on row 63. The hammer is ready at the chest with its
// head toward screen right, raised above and behind the near shoulder, then
// struck down onto the anvil's face with a few sparks. The handle stays open
// where the near fist closes round it.
canvas 64 64
anchor 32 64
frame act_worker 0
